    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential are pleased to introduce No. 1 Kelly’s Bay Parade, an impeccably maintained and contemporary three-bedroom, semi-detached family residence, nestled in the heart of Skerries’ mature and highly desirable residential enclave. This exceptional home is perfectly suited for families or those seeking a serene community setting, complemented by an array of outstanding local amenities just steps away.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a tranquil street, No. 1 Kelly’s Bay Parade offers an ideal balance for those who cherish an active, outdoor lifestyle while remaining conveniently close to Dublin City Centre. The ground floor welcomes you with a bright and generously proportioned hallway, featuring a convenient guest restroom. To the right, a spacious living room flows seamlessly into an expansive open-plan kitchen and dining area, enhanced by a large rear extension and a practical utility room, creating a versatile and inviting space for modern living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home offers two bright and specious double bedrooms, with the primary bedroom benefiting from a stylish en-suite, alongside a versatile single bedroom, ideal as a home office, and a modern family bathroom, all finished to a high standard.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property boasts a beautifully landscaped, south-east-facing garden, thoughtfully designed with lawn and an elevated deck patio, complete with ambient evening lighting - an idyllic setting for al fresco dining during the warmer months.\r\n\r\nSituated just a short stroll from the Skerries Point retail development, the home is also perfectly positioned beside both primary and secondary schools, making it ideal for growing families. Skerries itself is a thriving, picturesque seaside village, famous for its sandy beaches, bustling harbour, and award-winning restaurants. Residents can enjoy a wealth of amenities including Skerries Mills and Heritage Park, alongside an array of world-class sporting facilities. With excellent public transport links, including the Skerries train station, and easy access to the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport, No. 1 represents the perfect balance of seaside serenity and urban connectivity. \r\n\r\nViewings are highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality and charm of this remarkable property\r\n\r\n**Key Features**  \r\n\r\n- Immaculately presented, turnkey three-bedroom, semi-detached family home  \r\n- Generous and well-designed living spaces throughout  \r\n- South-east-facing rear garden, perfect for relaxation and entertaining  \r\n- Prime coastal location with easy access to local amenities  \r\n\r\n***Disclaimer:***\r\n*All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns.*"
      },
